<title>CANADA: TENNIS-QUEBEC CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QUEBEC CITY WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>QUEBEC CITY 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the singles</p>
<p>final at the $164,250 Bell Challenge women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Els Callens (Belgium) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
